# Keep text normalization identical across Windows Git, Linux tooling, and
# Databricks Git folders. Local editors may still choose their display style.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Required lexicons, reviewed overlays, and small fixtures must remain ordinary
# Git files so Databricks Git folders can read them without a Git LFS client.
# Raw and generated corpus CSVs are excluded separately in .gitignore.
*.csv text
*.pkl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
